== Overview ==
The '''Vacuum Toilet''' is a fast and tough [[Toilets|toilet]] that first appears in the [[Desert]] map. Its main gimmick is that at specific sections of the map, it will spin; sucking up and disabling any nearby small units for 10 seconds (fact-checked), and after some time it continues to move forward.

It does 300 damage to the base, so you can tank it (unless you on [[Abysmal Mode (The Void)|Abysmal Mode]]).

