== Strategy ==
* The '''Vacuum Toilet''' is very hard to defeat for new players, as it not only has more than double the health of [[Boss Toilet]] it is also very fast.
* With just [[Rare]] units alone, you are not able to defeat it(you could with [[Speaker Helicopter]] in the old Desert). 
* Any [[Epic]] unit can probably take this down except for possibly [[Large TV Man]]. 
* Make sure to memorize where the Vacuum Toilet uses its abilities, and place units around there to do the most damage.
* Any high DPS unit can take this down given you upgrade it enough.
* If Vacuum Toilet gets too far, you can use [[Secret Agent]] to bring a quick defeat to it.
* With any Legendary Unit, you can easily kill this and defeat Medium Mode.

== Trivia ==

* It is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Vacuum_Skibidi_Urinal?so=search Vacuum Skibidi Urinal] from the series (it is a urinal).
**Despite being a urinal both in the series and in the game, it is called a toilet in game.
* It was the main centerpiece of the [[Desert]] in the update it was added; being the 'boss' and being the main factor in making the map hard.
* This is the first [[Enemies|toilet]] added to the game which can "stun" your units.

